Looking at this problem, I need to find all $f: \mathbb{Z} \to \mathbb{Z}$ with $f(0)=2$ and $f(x+f(x+2y))=f(2x)+f(2y)$.

**Answer leak check:** The problem statement contains no leaked solutions or hints. Proceeding.

